---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { projects } from '../data/projects';
const selected = ['image-analysis-agent', 'reel-movie-agent'].map(slug => projects.find(p => p.slug === slug)).filter(Boolean);
const practice = [
  { title: 'Agents that do the work', text: 'LangGraph workflows, structured outputs, and tool orchestration. From purchase-order parsing to image analysis.', tools: 'LangGraph / Python / OpenAI' },
  { title: 'Knowledge you can trace', text: 'Hybrid search, document intelligence, and knowledge graphs. Answers connected to evidence people can inspect.', tools: 'RAG / pgvector / Neo4j / LightRAG' },
  { title: 'The path to production', text: 'Secure APIs and connected workflows, packaged for deployment and built to fit the systems around them.', tools: 'FastAPI / Docker / AWS / n8n' },
];
---
<Layout title="Mustafa Alnagdy | AI Engineering & Automation" description="AI agents, document intelligence, and automation. Explore Mustafa Alnagdy’s working software, engineering case studies, and process-engineering perspective.">
<Navbar /><main id="main-content">
<section class="home-hero wrap">
<div class="hero-composition">
<div class="hero-copy"><h1>AI systems.<br />Built to work.</h1><p>I’m Mustafa Alnagdy. I turn complex information and everyday workflows into useful AI software — from the first retrieval pipeline to the deployed service.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="#projects">Explore my work</a><a class="quiet-link" href="/Mustafa-Alnagdy-CV.pdf" download>Download CV</a></div><div class="hero-person"><img src="/images/mustafa-alnagdy.webp" width="1200" height="1600" alt="Mustafa Alnagdy" fetchpriority="high" /><div><strong>Engineer by training. Builder by practice.</strong><span>Based in Egypt · Working across disciplines</span></div></div></div>
<a class="hero-artifact" href="/projects/smart-rag" aria-label="Explore the Smart RAG case study"><div class="artifact-title"><span><span class="status-dot"></span> Smart RAG</span><span>In final development </span></div><div class="artifact-image"><img src="/images/projects/smart-rag/citation-page.jpg" alt="Smart RAG showing an original PDF page with highlighted citation evidence beside the conversation" width="1518" height="723" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="artifact-caption"><strong>An answer is only the beginning.</strong><span>Follow it back to the evidence.</span></div></a>
</div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>Applied AI, with a systems-engineering perspective.</span><a href="#projects">Scroll to explore </a></div>
</section>
<section id="projects" class="work-section section-space"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>Selected work.</h2><p>A selection of systems I’ve designed and developed.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/projects">View all projects </a></div>
<article class="featured-work"><a class="featured-image" href="/projects/smart-rag"><img src="/images/projects/smart-rag/ask.jpg" alt="Smart RAG document workspace displaying a sourced answer as a structured comparison table" width="1518" height="723" loading="lazy" /></a><div class="featured-copy"><div class="project-meta"><span>Document intelligence</span><span>2026 · In progress</span></div><h3><a href="/projects/smart-rag">Smart RAG</a></h3><p>Company knowledge, with the receipts. A full-stack workspace that combines hybrid retrieval, AI agents, and original PDF citations to make answers inspectable.</p><ul class="feature-points"><li>Semantic + keyword search</li><li>Original PDF page previews</li><li>Permission-aware evidence</li></ul><a class="text-link" href="/projects/smart-rag">Inside the project </a></div></article>
<div class="selected-grid">{selected.map(project => project && <article class="selected-work"><a class="selected-image" href={`/projects/${project.slug}`}><img src={project.image} alt={project.imageAlt} width={project.imageWidth ?? 1200} height={project.imageHeight ?? 675} loading="lazy" /></a><div class="project-meta"><span>{project.categories.join(' / ')}</span><span>{project.year}</span></div><h3><a href={`/projects/${project.slug}`}>{project.title}</a></h3><p>{project.shortDescription}</p><div class="inline-tags">{project.tags.slice(0, 3).map(tag => <span>{tag}</span>)}</div></article>)}</div>
<a class="archive-link" href="/projects"><span>There’s more behind the work.</span><span>Explore machine learning, automation & process systems </span></a>
</div></section>
<section id="about" class="about-section section-space"><div class="wrap about-grid"><div><h2>An engineering<br />way of thinking.</h2><div class="about-portrait"><img src="/images/mustafa-alnagdy.webp" alt="Mustafa Alnagdy, AI engineer and Cairo University graduate" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" /><span>Mustafa Alnagdy<br /><small>Banha, Egypt</small></span></div></div><div class="about-copy"><p class="large-copy">My route into AI started with understanding how real systems behave.</p><p>I graduated in Petrochemical Processing Systems Engineering at Cairo University. That background taught me to think in flows, constraints, failure modes, and the decisions a system needs to support.</p><p>Today, I apply that thinking to AI agents and automation: connecting models to tools, making knowledge searchable, and building the services and interfaces that turn a promising idea into something people can use.</p><p>At MIS, I work on production agents and automated workflows. Alongside that, I build independent projects and teach part-time at Cairo University’s Faculty of Engineering.</p><a class="text-link" href="/Mustafa-Alnagdy-CV.pdf" download>Get the full CV </a><div class="about-details"><span>Arabic · Native</span><span>English · Professional proficiency</span></div></div></div></section>
<section id="skills" class="practice-section section-space"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>From idea to<br />working system.</h2><p class="heading-note">The tools change.<br />The focus stays on useful outcomes.</p></div><div class="practice-grid">{practice.map(item => <article><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p><span>{item.tools}</span></article>)}</div></div></section>
<section id="experience" class="experience-section section-space"><div class="wrap experience-grid"><div><h2>Where I have<br />worked.</h2><p>A foundation in engineering.<br />A practice in applied AI.</p><a class="text-link" href="/Mustafa-Alnagdy-CV.pdf" download>Download my CV </a></div><div class="timeline"><article><div class="timeline-meta"><span>Cairo University</span><time>Sep 2026 — Present</time></div><h3>Teaching Assistant <small>Part-time</small></h3><p>Faculty of Engineering, Cairo University.</p></article><article><div class="timeline-meta"><span>MIS</span><time>Aug 2025 — Present</time></div><h3>AI Agents & Automation Intern</h3><p>LangGraph PO Parser and Image Tagger agents delivered through FastAPI. HMAC authentication, rate limits, Docker and Caddy on AWS EC2, with Supabase and Airtable integrations.</p></article><article><div class="timeline-meta"><span>Waste Marche</span><time>Jun — Jul 2025</time></div><h3>Social Media Intern</h3><p>Data-informed sustainability content covering carbon footprints, waste management, and industrial training.</p></article><article><div class="timeline-meta"><span>Onspec · ENPPI · Petrojet</span><time>2023 — 2024</time></div><h3>Process Engineering Internships</h3><p>Process simulation in Aspen HYSYS, pump performance, process safety, and engineering documentation from BFDs to P&IDs.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section id="education" class="education-section"><div class="wrap education-grid"><div><img src="/images/cairo_university_logo.jpeg" width="200" height="200" alt="Cairo University" loading="lazy" /><div><h2>Cairo University</h2><p>B.Sc. Petrochemical Processing Systems Engineering</p><span>Graduated June 2026 · GPA 3.65</span></div></div><p>Graduation thesis: designing a 1,500 ton/day industrial gypsum plant, from mass and heat balances to equipment sizing, economic feasibility, and HAZID/HAZOP studies.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap learning-note"><h3>Continuing to learn.</h3><p>DataCamp Data Science Professional Certificate (in progress); Circular Economy, Cairo University; Process Safety, ENPPI; Web Development, Udacity.</p></div>
<section id="contact" class="contact-section section-space"><div class="wrap"><p>Have a problem worth building for?</p><h2>Let’s make<br />something useful.</h2><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:mustafaalnagdy26@gmail.com">mustafaalnagdy26@gmail.com </a><div class="contact-bottom"><span>AI engineering · Automation · Applied machine learning</span><div><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mustafa-alnagdy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn </a><a href="https://github.com/Nagdy8888" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub </a><a href="tel:+201068878853">Call me</a></div></div></div></section>
</main><Footer /></Layout>
